        "original_id": "9424a51f-5446-5d33-9d47-44a23f236dde",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Battle Born Studios, Winchester, Nevada, Clark County, Nevada, Las Vegas Township, Las Vegas Strip\n- Organizations: The Killers, Imagine Dragons\n- Products: Hell and Silence, \"Hear Me\"\n\nFacts:\n- Winchester, Nevada, is an unincorporated town and census-designated place in Las Vegas Township, Clark County, Nevada, United States, and it contains part of the Las Vegas Strip.\n- Battle Born Studios is a 2000-square-foot recording studio in Winchester, Nevada, and The Killers own it.\n- Hell and Silence was recorded at Battle Born Studios.\n- Imagine Dragons originally wrote and recorded the song \"Hear Me\" for their second extended play, Hell and Silence.",
